{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/villa-del-gavi-mr-eight-development-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":27,"crm_id":"4896","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Villa Del Gavi","slug":"villa-del-gavi-mr-eight-development-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Mr Eight Development","price":3600000,"display_price":"3.6M","lattitude":25.2983128,"longitude":55.2950412,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Located on the iconic <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a>, Villa Del Gavi introduces a new chapter of waterfront sophistication. Developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-mr-eight-development/\">Mr. Eight</a>, a name synonymous with refined European craftsmanship, the project features <strong>2, 3, and 4-bedroom residences in simplex and duplex formats</strong>. Designed for modern families who appreciate both privacy and grandeur, homes at Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development include ceiling heights of up to 6.7 meters, natural Italian finishes, and panoramic views of the Arabian Gulf.</p><p>The development combines exceptional design with a lifestyle driven by world-class services. From valet parking and private massage treatments to golf carts and a members-only beach club, every detail is curated for the residents’ comfort. The iconic lobby alone is a showpiece of international design talent, showcasing décor by Lasvit, B&amp;B Italia, and Tom Dixon. The location of Villa Del Gavi also ensures seamless access to Dubai’s vibrant lifestyle while offering unmatched serenity—making it one of the most compelling luxury investments in the region.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_6e58702536.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_6e58702536","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_86e0ef7b90.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_86e0ef7b90","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_e0c1b512a8.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_e0c1b512a8","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_9821f272e1.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_9821f272e1","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_eb2a98cd9f.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_eb2a98cd9f","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_592925fb83.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_592925fb83","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_c115ea4169.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_c115ea4169","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_5457ad72cb.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_5457ad72cb","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_90f55395f0.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_90f55395f0","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"}],"images":null,"characteristics_module":{"id":1488,"cta":{"id":2267,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_4bdf78ae37.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_4bdf78ae37","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},"style":null,"title":"Villa Del Gavi – Where Architecture Breathes Elegance","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li><strong>Exclusive Beachfront Living:</strong> Villa Del Gavi at Dubai Islands offers direct access to a private shoreline, blending luxury with ultimate coastal serenity.</li><li><strong>Designed by Mr. Eight Development:</strong> Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development reflects over two decades of European expertise in crafting homes that feel like bespoke masterpieces.</li><li><strong>Architectural Statement Lobby:</strong> Step into a 300 sq.m. grand lobby at Villa Del Gavi, featuring 7-meter ceilings and world-renowned décor brands like Cassina and Lalique.</li><li><strong>Branded Italian Interiors:</strong> Residences are finished with natural travertine, CALACATTA VIOLA marble, and kitchens by Febal Casa with SMEG appliances—all imported from Italy.</li><li><strong>Duplexes with Double-Height Ceilings:</strong> Select 3 and 4-bedroom duplexes feature dramatic 6.7-meter ceilings, setting Villa Del Gavi apart in spatial elegance and architectural volume.</li><li><strong>Premium Home Services Included: </strong>Residents enjoy elite services—concierge, valet, private beach club, Rolls Royce fleet, and even a Riva motorboat—managed in-house for seamless luxury.</li><li><strong>Low-Density, High-Privacy Living:</strong> With only 87 residences in the entire development, the location of Villa Del Gavi ensures exclusivity and tranquility rarely found in Dubai.</li><li><strong>Strategic Island Location:</strong> Villa Del Gavi Location on Dubai Islands places it close to the city’s heartbeat, while offering a rare escape into nature and sea views.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1489,"cta":{"id":2268,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_673a932b25.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_673a932b25","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},"style":null,"title":"Seaside Sanctuary, City Connectivity – The Best of Both Worlds","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The location of Villa Del Gavi on Dubai Islands offers a rare balance between serene coastal living and effortless access to the city’s dynamic heart. Just minutes from Deira, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Downtown Dubai</a>, and Dubai International Airport, residents can enjoy a quiet beachfront lifestyle without sacrificing urban convenience. From morning strolls along the shore to spontaneous evenings in the city, Villa Del Gavi at Dubai Islands makes it all possible. This emerging waterfront destination is set to become a cultural and leisure hub, enhancing the appeal of the Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development as not just a home—but a well-connected lifestyle statement.</p><ul><li>4 minutes to Deira Mall</li><li>7 minutes to Centara Beach Resort</li><li>8 minutes to Dubai Hospital</li><li>9 minutes to Hyatt Regency Dubai</li><li>14 minutes to Gold Souk</li><li>19 minutes to Dubai International Airport (DXB)</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3879,"url":null,"file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":2592,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3522,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,016 to 2,288 sq. ft.","media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3523,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,659 to 4,148 sq. ft.","media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3524,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"2,498 to 4,360 sq. ft.","media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"35/65","payment_plans":[{"id":10175,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":10176,"title":"15%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":10177,"title":"65%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Dubai Islands","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":23500,"url":null,"text":"24/7 Concierge","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23501,"url":null,"text":"Private beach club membership","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23502,"url":null,"text":"Valet parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23503,"url":null,"text":"Rolls Royce car fleet for residents (1 Phantom, 2 Ghosts, and 2 Cullinans)","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23504,"url":null,"text":"Porter services across the territory","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23505,"url":null,"text":"Private motorboat for residents (Italian brand Riva)","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23506,"url":null,"text":"In-home massage services","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23507,"url":null,"text":"3 golf carts for resident use","type":null,"image":null},{"id":23508,"url":null,"text":"Branded Gym","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1180,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Villa Del Gavi","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Villa Del Gavi","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Mr. Eight Development","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_d3f4a0ca69.jpg","hash":"Villa_Del_Gavi_Iconic_Beachfront_Living_on_Dubai_Islands_d3f4a0ca69","name":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands"},"seo":{"id":1751,"metaTitle":"Villa Del Gavi – Iconic Beachfront Living on Dubai Islands","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Live grand at Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development—an iconic residential retreat with exquisite finishes and breathtaking Dubai Islands views."},"more_info":[{"id":6338,"answer":"<p>Villa Del Gavi is a luxury beachfront residential development by Mr. Eight Development, located on Dubai Islands. It features a limited collection of 2 to 4-bedroom simplex and duplex residences with sea views and premium Italian finishes.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Villa Del Gavi and where is it located?"},{"id":6339,"answer":"<p>Villa Del Gavi by Mr. Eight Development is brought to you by a renowned European developer with over 20 years of experience and several award-winning residential projects across Europe.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Villa Del Gavi?"},{"id":6340,"answer":"<p>The development o